{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Call of Duty\u00ae experience supports Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 6, and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Treyarch and Raven Software are bringing players the biggest Black Ops ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 6 is signature Black Ops across a cinematic single-player Campaign, a best-in-class Multiplayer experience and with the epic return of Round-Based Zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 is the massive free-to-play combat arena, featuring Battle Royale and Resurgence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae Points (CP*) are the in-game currency that can be used in Black Ops 7, Black Ops 6, Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Modern Warfare\u00ae II and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 to obtain new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 6, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae II or Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 required to redeem. Sold / downloaded separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP purchased may also be used to obtain in-game content in certain Call of Duty\u00ae games with CP functionality enabled*. Each game sold separately.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Crappy Way to Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1938090/923b117e27557ba4a6e37cdf182b8e2a200f7484.jpg"},{"name":"Backpack Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1938090/b41e0527948bcb3d44b9c72a4dfa35ed1f6b9420.jpg"},{"name":"Crocodile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1938090/ae252112faaf25d9b75d575cb43f12b232e60452.jpg"},{"name":"Daredevil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1